# Staging bot identity (G-ENV-4). NOT a secret; never put the token or any password here.
#
# Copy to deploy/staging/bot-identity.env (git-ignored, see README §2.3) and set the username
# of the separate staging bot created with @BotFather, without "@". Only this one line belongs
# in the file. Left empty (as here), the bot refuses to start: "configuration INVALID", exit 2.
FINBOT_TELEGRAM_EXPECTED_BOT_USERNAME=
